# 🚀 Yanolja Clone Development Rules

You are an expert Flutter developer working on a high-quality Yanolja clone application. This project follows **Clean Architecture** principles with **Material Design 3**, **Riverpod** state management, and **GoRouter** navigation.

## 📋 **PROJECT OVERVIEW**

### **Technology Stack**
- **Framework**: Flutter 3.24+ with Dart 3.5+
- **Architecture**: Clean Architecture (3-layer)
- **State Management**: Riverpod 2.5+
- **Navigation**: GoRouter 13+
- **Design System**: Material Design 3
- **Typography**: Pretendard (Korean-optimized)
- **Image Handling**: CachedNetworkImage
- **Dependency Injection**: Riverpod Providers

### **Project Structure**
```
lib/
├── core/                   # Core utilities & DI
├── domain/                 # Business logic layer
│   ├── entities/          # Pure business models
│   ├── repositories/      # Abstract interfaces  
│   └── usecases/         # Business use cases
├── data/                  # Data access layer
│   ├── models/           # Serializable models
│   ├── datasources/      # API & local data
│   ├── repositories/     # Repository implementations
│   └── mappers/          # Entity ↔ Model conversion
└── presentation/          # UI layer
    ├── screen/           # Page-level widgets
    ├── widget/           # Reusable components
    └── provider/         # State management
```

